standalone_hyenadna.py is vendored verbatim from the HyenaDNA repository
(HazyResearch / LongSafari), which is licensed under Apache License 2.0.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/HazyResearch/hyena-dna
  License:   Apache-2.0 (see ./LICENSE)

GLMap's HyenaDNA loader (glmap/loaders/hyenadna.py) imports this single
self-contained module so the LongSafari/hyenadna-* checkpoints (which are not
AutoModel-compatible) can be loaded. No other files from the upstream repo are
required. Model weights are downloaded separately from the Hugging Face Hub
(LongSafari/hyenadna-*).
